 "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982689_3981216512154590_4189994664470531211_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1cYffAyNMKQQ7kNvwFrQ6Ja&_nc_oc=Adk60i3CVYCmZCTT9K1M7LZGX-aZ9NtO0BpV1ckdnghxnx5u6gVO0C1889sHYSBYPUQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyqRvkFvbxSnLM_7Pua38tDpcdTY5u2tGaoZkKKtqQgFg&oe=69B00B7D"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "3788946934685427", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982526_3788946941352093_2852083901156275729_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SHIVjHtOoS4Q7kNvwGksYid&_nc_oc=AdkekS_GadqV3SQzkk17Zt4UbaZjaCzttvf5R3ZNKTUNX0g1vnBEIhfSRCCd3YKMS1c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afx-UvWkwjGXtctY7Xy7zKgPBo4ri6z15yd_IVbtTmWawg&oe=69B020B8"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "trailer_cover2560x1440.png", "id": "1967784354025475", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820923_1967784357358808_6227872389427305062_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eqi54CZSgJMQ7kNvwGQ7XqM&_nc_oc=AdnsOu9UgQpMPchvGLqVNSE_VvfDoX69Ly704R2h3ZTxLjG-ci5ffU8A4CJxLF3bpfo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwJHgiv6pOnCFAiq-pZGQ5gqBvlDp7ZZZ0WTBNrtkwiJQ&oe=69B02026"}, "display_name": "Garden Haven", "keywords": ["cozy", "cute", "flower", "garden", "mr"], "long_description": "\n**This is an early access game**. It is still in development and may have bugs! It may increase the price once there is more content in it. Your feedback will help us make it better. Thank you!\n\n\n\n\n\n{1259229111805940}\n\nWelcome to **Garden Haven**, a cozy Mixed Reality experience where your room becomes a lush garden ready to bloom. Transform everyday surfaces like tables, beds, and shelves into planting areas, creating a haven filled with vibrant flowers, fresh vegetables, and thriving greenery.\n\nStep into your garden each day to nurture your plants\u2014water, trim, and fertilize them with care. Alongside you is the gentle **Garden Spirit**, an adorable guide who teaches you the secrets of gardening. Feed her with what your garden produces\u2014colorful blooms, juicy fruits, or seeds\u2014and she will grow, evolving into a beautiful fairy who rewards your dedication.\n\nBut remember, a garden requires love and attention. Neglect it, and your plants will wither, leaving the Garden Spirit no choice but to say goodbye.\n\nGarden Haven is a peaceful, family-friendly escape that blends learning, relaxation, and magic. It\u2019s the perfect place to chill, grow, and discover the joy of bringing nature to life\u2014right in your own room.\n\n**How will your garden grow?**\n", "short_description": "Garden Haven transforms your room into a lush Mixed Reality garden on Meta Quest 3 and 3s. Use your hands\u2014no controllers needed\u2014to plant, water, and nurture flowers and vegetables on real-world surfaces like tables and beds. With help from the adorable Garden Spirit, learn to care for your plants and watch her evolve into a magical fairy. Relax, grow, and bring nature to life in this cozy, family-friendly escape. \nHow will your garden grow?"}]}, "developer_name": "Resistance Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://resistancestudio.com/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Resistance Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.resistancestudio.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1819021644882647"}, {"id": "810139357995560"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED_FOR_DOWNLOAD", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "support